{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_205_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_205","textTraditional":"一、二十有四年，春，王二月，丙戌，仲孫貜卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_205_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_205","textTraditional":"二、婼至自晉。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_205_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_205","textTraditional":"大夫執則致，致則挈，由上致之也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_205_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_205","textTraditional":"三、夏，五月，乙未，朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_205_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_205","textTraditional":"四、秋，八月，大雩。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_205_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_205","textTraditional":"五、丁酉，杞伯郁釐卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_205_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_205","textTraditional":"六、冬，吳滅巢。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_205_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_205","textTraditional":"七、葬杞平公。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}